WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:13.240
Police!

2
00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:15.200
-Hands on your head!
-Go on!

3
00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:17.440
Nobody move!

4
00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:19.760
-Police!
-They've got an automatic!

5
00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:21.840
-Hands on your head!
-Rear secured.

6
00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:24.560
-Get on the floor!
-Police!

7
00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:26.680
-Confirmed.
-Stay calm.

8
00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.720
-Police!
-Police. open up!

9
00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:31.240
Police. open up!

10
00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:34.600
Explosive set.

11
00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:35.800
Three.

12
00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:36.760
Two.

13
00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:38.200
One.

14
00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:48.720
"Valère in position!" "Okay. here I go."

15
00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:54.040
Someone's waiting for you at the entrance.

16
00:00:56.440 --> 00:00:59.440
Okay. Cédric. do you think that
for the next drill. I could--

17
00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:01.040
Listen. Max.

18
00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:05.680
You're a good teammate. honestly.
Really. I mean it.

19
00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:11.360
In two weeks. your future will be decided.
Whatever it is. it won't be with the GIGN.

20
00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:15.680
My job is to be section leader
without David and you. okay?

21
00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:18.560
It's pointless for me to include you.

22
00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:21.200
But take a break. Go see your visitor.

23
00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:32.600
RESTRICTED AREA

24
00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:34.280
WARNING
ELECTRIC FENCE

25
00:01:43.840 --> 00:01:47.560
ELITE FORCE

26
00:02:33.160 --> 00:02:35.200
This is Manon's voicemail…

27
00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:37.720
I told her to leave her phone on.
She didn't.

28
00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:41.160
Is she at the conservatory?
Is she at Nina's? Are they together?

29
00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:43.440
-Do we need to--
-I'll take care of Manon.

30
00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:45.640
Stop worrying and go to work.

31
00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:47.960
Besides. I have a secret mission.

32
00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:51.440
I want to become section leader
of stay-at-home dads.

33
00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:55.440
Whether that's in Paris or Hong Kong.
It's all the same to me.

34
00:02:55.520 --> 00:02:56.400
Singapore.

35
00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:59.000
Hong Kong. Singapore. either works.

36
00:03:00.760 --> 00:03:03.440
-So. should I go?
-Yeah. go ahead. I've got this.

37
00:03:08.720 --> 00:03:10.360
-Your phone.
-Right.

38
00:03:10.880 --> 00:03:13.520
-Your coffee.
-Thanks. That's sweet of you.

39
00:03:15.360 --> 00:03:16.280
I love you.

40
00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:25.320
Your father had just joined
the Gendarmerie with David.

41
00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:27.440
He hadn't met Jess yet.

42
00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:31.280
We were kids. We weren't even your age.

43
00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:34.920
Laurent went on a four-month assignment
to New Caledonia.

44
00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:37.480
I had my job. I couldn't go with him.

45
00:03:37.560 --> 00:03:41.320
A few days after he came back.
I noticed my period was late.

46
00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:44.120
I took a test. I was pregnant with you.

47
00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:46.080
We cried with joy.

48
00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:49.160
Our families thought we were too young.
We didn't care.

49
00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:52.880
The day you were born
was the happiest day of our lives.

50
00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:56.200
You were growing up.

51
00:03:56.720 --> 00:04:00.160
Laurent and I wanted you to have
a little brother or sister.

52
00:04:00.680 --> 00:04:04.720
So we tried again.
For weeks. for months. But it didn't work.

53
00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:08.560
We went to see a doctor.
and that's when we found out.

54
00:04:09.880 --> 00:04:12.040
Laurent had never been able to have kids.

55
00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:20.240
Until then. I always thought
Laurent was your father.

56
00:04:23.320 --> 00:04:25.120
Why are you telling me all this?

57
00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:28.960
So I'll forgive you. is that it?

58
00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:31.040
To say. "I get it. it's no big deal"?

59
00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:34.200
I don't need you to forgive me.

60
00:04:34.720 --> 00:04:37.480
You're my greatest achievement.
I'm not sorry.

61
00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:39.520
But you lied to me.

62
00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:42.840
You cheated on Dad. With David.

63
00:04:43.360 --> 00:04:45.400
Why didn't you tell me after he died?

64
00:04:46.120 --> 00:04:48.000
Would it have helped you if I had?

65
00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:49.800
I didn't tell you to protect you.

66
00:04:49.880 --> 00:04:52.160
Of course it would.
I have a dad who's alive!

67
00:04:53.240 --> 00:04:54.880
I had a right to know.

68
00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:01.240
I kept David away from you.

69
00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:03.200
What?

70
00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:05.640
Your father died
because David went to talk to him.

71
00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:07.800
How dare he approach you after that?

72
00:05:07.880 --> 00:05:10.160
Because we slept together.
once. 25 years ago?

73
00:05:11.920 --> 00:05:15.160
You took my father from me.
Do you realize that? How dare you?

74
00:05:26.920 --> 00:05:27.960
Fuck.

75
00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:30.520
Max.

76
00:05:35.840 --> 00:05:36.800
Shit.

77
00:05:47.640 --> 00:05:48.640
Yeah?

78
00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:52.280
David. it's Valère.
Do you know where your daughter is?

79
00:05:52.360 --> 00:05:54.440
What's going on? Why do you ask?

80
00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:56.200
Her conservatory.

81
00:05:56.720 --> 00:05:59.280
Hostage situation.
We don't know who's inside.

82
00:06:11.120 --> 00:06:14.120
FRENCH ARMY

83
00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:23.760
Approaching. Target confirmed.

84
00:06:24.560 --> 00:06:26.160
Sir. please.

85
00:06:28.480 --> 00:06:29.640
Okay. it's fine.

86
00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:36.160
Fox 1 in position.

87
00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:52.040
Fox 3 in position.

88
00:07:08.160 --> 00:07:11.120
Delta 5 to command.
The entrances are rigged.

89
00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:12.680
Identification in progress.

90
00:07:22.320 --> 00:07:25.960
Hovering in position above the target.

91
00:07:31.160 --> 00:07:33.680
Speak with command.
Establish a list of hostages.

92
00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:35.560
-Okay.
-A quick briefing.

93
00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:38.480
I'll check the van out front.
It hasn't moved in 24 hours.

94
00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:40.760
Okay. sure. Quick briefing.

95
00:07:40.840 --> 00:07:42.720
They arrived on site yesterday night.

96
00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:45.400
They have assault rifles.
They're masked and ready.

97
00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:49.400
They started shooting at 9:00 a.m.
Two were injured but managed to escape.

98
00:07:49.480 --> 00:07:51.560
No updates from the terrorists since.

99
00:07:51.640 --> 00:07:54.320
We think they're holed up inside.

100
00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:58.000
I have three support units.
They're on the station roof. Okay?

101
00:07:58.080 --> 00:07:59.680
Have we identified the Oscars?

102
00:07:59.760 --> 00:08:01.400
Any minute now.

103
00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:02.880
Status on the assault?

104
00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:05.040
Not yet. I don't have enough visibility.

105
00:08:05.120 --> 00:08:06.800
Do we have a 55 on the targets?

106
00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:10.160
Are we in contact with them. at least?

107
00:08:10.240 --> 00:08:12.480
They're not answering.
They're well-prepared.

108
00:08:12.560 --> 00:08:14.400
Thanks. David. I know what I'm doing.

109
00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:19.240
Worryingly. they have hostages
but they haven't made any demands.

110
00:08:20.080 --> 00:08:22.280
We don't know their plan
but we know what to do.

111
00:08:22.920 --> 00:08:24.640
Be ready to move in.

112
00:08:24.720 --> 00:08:25.560
Let's go!

113
00:08:25.640 --> 00:08:27.880
Come on. guys. let's go!

114
00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:33.560
-Get me in touch with command.
-I'll call them.

115
00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:35.680
I need that hostage list. guys.

116
00:08:35.760 --> 00:08:37.240
Wait. here it is.

117
00:08:37.840 --> 00:08:38.840
We have the list.

118
00:08:38.920 --> 00:08:39.960
Please print it out.

119
00:08:42.800 --> 00:08:44.400
Yeah. I'm on site.

120
00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:47.800
We don't know if she's in there.

121
00:08:48.360 --> 00:08:49.440
What do you know?

122
00:08:49.520 --> 00:08:52.120
Not much. to be honest. I just got here.

123
00:08:52.200 --> 00:08:54.560
I'll keep you posted
as soon as I find out.

124
00:08:54.640 --> 00:08:56.240
Okay. Well. the thing is.

125
00:08:56.320 --> 00:08:58.760
I can't get hold of
her friend Nina either. so…

126
00:09:03.280 --> 00:09:04.600
-Wait.
-They're…

127
00:09:16.520 --> 00:09:17.400
She's in there.

128
00:09:31.080 --> 00:09:32.720
Not my baby.

129
00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:33.720
Jess.

130
00:09:38.080 --> 00:09:41.680
I'll get her out of there. Jess.
I promise. You hear me?

131
00:09:43.160 --> 00:09:45.080
I promise. I'll call you back.

132
00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:46.920
No. wait.

133
00:09:54.960 --> 00:09:56.040
David!

134
00:09:59.120 --> 00:10:00.160
David!

135
00:10:00.720 --> 00:10:02.920
What are you doing?
Thinking of going alone?

136
00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:04.920
Let us handle it.
We know what we're doing.

137
00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:08.840
Really? If you know what you're doing.
why didn't you set up an entry team?

138
00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:12.480
We don't know how many there are.
Entrances are rigged. We can't get in.

139
00:10:12.560 --> 00:10:15.280
I didn't say to send in an entry team.
just set one up!

140
00:10:15.360 --> 00:10:18.720
If you need one and you haven't set it up.
that's 30 seconds lost.

141
00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:20.440
We don't even know where they are!

142
00:10:20.520 --> 00:10:24.480
We don't have CCTV or contact.
and we don't know what they want.

143
00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:28.840
Hey. I'm not stupid.
I know Manon's in there.

144
00:10:28.920 --> 00:10:31.720
You're not in charge here. I am. Okay?
Let me do my job.

145
00:10:31.800 --> 00:10:34.800
Don't worry. Cédric.
I know you're in charge.

146
00:10:34.880 --> 00:10:37.920
You know what?
You manage your team. I'll manage myself.

147
00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:41.360
Stop. for fuck's sake.
You know I can't let you go. Stop.

148
00:10:41.440 --> 00:10:42.560
Don't touch me!

149
00:10:54.840 --> 00:10:56.960
For fuck's sake. I'm sorry.

150
00:10:57.960 --> 00:10:59.240
I'm sorry. Cédric.

151
00:11:02.080 --> 00:11:03.320
You're emotional.

152
00:11:04.520 --> 00:11:06.440
That's normal. You can't think straight.

153
00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:08.880
You have to trust me. okay? Look at me.

154
00:11:09.960 --> 00:11:12.120
We'll get all the hostages out. Unharmed.

155
00:11:13.800 --> 00:11:16.240
-Okay?
-Yeah.

156
00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:17.640
Want to be with us? Focus.

157
00:11:17.720 --> 00:11:21.040
You're the only one who knows
the layout inside. Can you do this?

158
00:11:21.120 --> 00:11:23.080
I'm with you.

159
00:11:23.600 --> 00:11:24.640
Okay. let's go.

160
00:11:27.520 --> 00:11:29.480
Get back to work. Show time's over.

161
00:11:29.560 --> 00:11:31.760
According to witnesses. several masked men

162
00:11:31.840 --> 00:11:34.920
who were heavily armed
took conservatory students hostage

163
00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:36.920
at around nine o'clock this morning.

164
00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:39.120
A security perimeter has been set up.

165
00:11:39.200 --> 00:11:42.200
We don't have any further information
on the operation.

166
00:11:42.280 --> 00:11:45.520
We're waiting to find out
if they've set up a direct line

167
00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:48.280
or opened negotiations
with the hostage-takers.

168
00:11:48.360 --> 00:11:52.760
We don't know the names or demands
of the hostage-takers.

169
00:11:52.840 --> 00:11:56.240
-Okay. got it. Thank you.
-Guys.

170
00:11:56.320 --> 00:12:00.280
I have a helicopter hovering.
but not for long. We'll have to move fast.

171
00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:01.920
I've sent out a drone.

172
00:12:02.000 --> 00:12:04.640
All the entrances to the building
are rigged.

173
00:12:04.720 --> 00:12:07.280
It's all glass. so we're visible.
Except here.

174
00:12:07.880 --> 00:12:09.640
There's one blind spot.

175
00:12:09.720 --> 00:12:12.440
And here in green
are all the telecom lines.

176
00:12:12.520 --> 00:12:16.320
If we can plug into them. we could access
all the cameras in the building.

177
00:12:16.400 --> 00:12:18.880
-Is that the rest of the network?
-Yeah.

178
00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:20.680
Plug in here. Entry team here.

179
00:12:21.360 --> 00:12:24.560
Valère. take part of Section 1.
Set up an entry team there.

180
00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:25.840
Okay.

181
00:12:25.920 --> 00:12:27.640
I'll need one of Chloé's guys too.

182
00:12:27.720 --> 00:12:30.640
Sure. Rapha. can you go with Valère?

183
00:12:30.720 --> 00:12:33.240
-Of course.
-Take any equipment you need to tap in.

184
00:12:33.320 --> 00:12:34.200
Okay.

185
00:12:34.280 --> 00:12:35.960
I'll go back to tracking the van.

186
00:12:36.040 --> 00:12:37.560
Okay. let's go.

187
00:12:47.840 --> 00:12:49.960
Cédric gave me the okay to come.

188
00:12:53.560 --> 00:12:54.760
I'm sorry about Manon.

189
00:12:58.320 --> 00:12:59.600
She's my little sister.

190
00:13:00.720 --> 00:13:02.280
We'll get her out of there.

191
00:13:02.360 --> 00:13:03.600
Hang in there.

192
00:13:11.920 --> 00:13:13.640
Yeah. I'm coming.

193
00:13:19.120 --> 00:13:20.200
I'm not moving. sir.

194
00:13:20.280 --> 00:13:22.320
Back up. I've told you three times.

195
00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:24.560
She's with me.

196
00:13:24.640 --> 00:13:25.560
Okay.

197
00:13:26.560 --> 00:13:28.080
Open up. guys.

198
00:13:43.440 --> 00:13:46.040
Alright. focus. Time to lock in. guys.

199
00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:54.400
Let's go.

200
00:14:09.600 --> 00:14:11.160
It's my daughter. I'm staying.

201
00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:14.800
Jess. stay in the car.

202
00:14:16.720 --> 00:14:17.640
Okay.

203
00:14:18.160 --> 00:14:19.080
I'll be back.

204
00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:21.640
With Manon.

205
00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:24.240
I know you will.

206
00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:50.000
Yes. family members
are starting to arrive on the scene.

207
00:14:50.080 --> 00:14:52.960
A psychological support unit
has been set up.

208
00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:55.520
Obviously. there's shock and confusion…

209
00:14:58.200 --> 00:15:01.760
We're in through door three.
Fifty meters from the lobby.

210
00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:14.040
How's it going. Cédric?

211
00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:18.440
We should be plugged in any minute now.
We'll have the live feed. Valère?

212
00:15:19.480 --> 00:15:21.440
-Your status?
-We're entering the lobby.

213
00:15:32.280 --> 00:15:33.680
Backup in position.

214
00:16:01.320 --> 00:16:02.440
Okay. in position.

215
00:16:02.520 --> 00:16:03.680
Okay.

216
00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:05.280
Let's plug in.

217
00:16:15.600 --> 00:16:16.920
Connecting.

218
00:16:31.720 --> 00:16:32.960
Link established.

219
00:16:33.040 --> 00:16:35.400
-We're in.
-Oscars and Tangos in the auditorium.

220
00:16:35.480 --> 00:16:38.680
Three armed Tangos. Nine Oscars are hooded
and grouped together.

221
00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:40.160
Check the other cameras.

222
00:16:42.960 --> 00:16:43.840
We're under fire!

223
00:16:45.280 --> 00:16:48.320
-Rapha!
-Two men down. I repeat. two men down.

224
00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:51.040
-Valère. take cover! Go back in!
-They're shooting!

225
00:16:52.640 --> 00:16:53.920
You're gonna be okay. Rapha.

226
00:16:55.000 --> 00:16:57.120
Sniper!

227
00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:06.880
They're shooting!

228
00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:09.040
Rapha. are you okay? Can you hear me?

229
00:17:09.120 --> 00:17:11.400
-Fuck.
-It must be coming from next door. Cédric.

230
00:17:12.480 --> 00:17:14.800
We're evacuating. Quick!

231
00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:16.000
Go ahead.

232
00:17:16.080 --> 00:17:17.640
Guys. two pairs with me!

233
00:17:19.360 --> 00:17:20.600
Valère. can you hear me?

234
00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:22.920
-Stay with me.
-Let's move. Come on!

235
00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:24.080
Keep going.

236
00:17:26.960 --> 00:17:29.640
-We're evacuating. Two wounded.
-Fuck!

237
00:17:39.640 --> 00:17:41.960
Confirmed. shots fired
from the building next door.

238
00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:48.640
Under fire at the east entrance.

239
00:17:56.320 --> 00:17:58.440
David. report position.
Have you taken cover?

240
00:17:58.520 --> 00:18:00.760
-We're in.
-Wait…

241
00:18:00.840 --> 00:18:02.840
Secure the position. I'm sending backup.

242
00:18:06.400 --> 00:18:09.480
Reposition towards east entrance.
I repeat. reposition…

243
00:18:09.560 --> 00:18:13.200
We just heard isolated shots
followed by bursts of automatic fire.

244
00:18:13.280 --> 00:18:15.400
The GIGN must be entering the premises.

245
00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:22.880
She's bleeding out.
we need to apply pressure.

246
00:18:22.960 --> 00:18:25.040
-We need a pulmonologist.
-I'll call them.

247
00:18:25.680 --> 00:18:27.280
Hold the pelvis down.

248
00:18:27.360 --> 00:18:29.080
Good. they're loading them now.

249
00:18:29.880 --> 00:18:31.280
All right. we're good.

250
00:18:31.360 --> 00:18:32.280
Okay.

251
00:18:33.240 --> 00:18:35.000
You have the second victim.

252
00:18:35.080 --> 00:18:36.840
-I'm listening.
-All right.

253
00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:39.760
Look at me. You're going to be fine. okay?

254
00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:41.440
-Rapha!
-I've got her!

255
00:18:41.520 --> 00:18:43.120
Okay. are you good?

256
00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:45.720
We need you. okay? You'll be fine.

257
00:18:45.800 --> 00:18:47.360
Keep your eyes open. It's okay.

258
00:18:47.960 --> 00:18:49.760
She was shot in her right side.

259
00:18:50.280 --> 00:18:51.560
You'll be fine. Rapha.

260
00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:54.560
Ma'am. can you hear me?

261
00:18:55.960 --> 00:18:57.840
-Give me the gauze pads.
-Gauze pad.

262
00:18:59.680 --> 00:19:00.680
Go on.

263
00:19:00.760 --> 00:19:03.200
Come on. open your eyes. ma'am.
Squeeze my hand.

264
00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:05.040
Ma'am. open your eyes.

265
00:19:05.800 --> 00:19:07.440
Open your eyes if you can hear me.

266
00:19:07.520 --> 00:19:08.720
-Careful.
-I can take over.

267
00:19:08.800 --> 00:19:10.840
You're with the paramedics.

268
00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:12.360
Stay with us. ma'am.

269
00:19:12.440 --> 00:19:14.360
-Ma'am. open your eyes.
-Open your eyes.

270
00:19:14.440 --> 00:19:17.600
Open the gates! It's leaving!

271
00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:22.840
Clear!

272
00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:24.400
-Clear!
-Go!

273
00:19:47.800 --> 00:19:49.800
Wait. Schwepps. Wait.

274
00:19:51.480 --> 00:19:53.040
Let's check the roof.

275
00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:59.200
It seems that GIGN officers were injured
in an exchange of gunfire in the building…

276
00:19:59.800 --> 00:20:01.440
Chloé. look at this camera feed.

277
00:20:02.000 --> 00:20:03.200
Two more are up there.

278
00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:08.560
Cédric. there are five Tangos
in the auditorium.

279
00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:12.680
There it is.

280
00:20:12.760 --> 00:20:14.600
I tracked down the van.

281
00:20:14.680 --> 00:20:16.720
It left a warehouse in Ivry
yesterday morning.

282
00:20:16.800 --> 00:20:20.000
Okay. we're on it.
Rico. come here. take over for me.

283
00:20:20.080 --> 00:20:21.680
Come on. let's go.

284
00:20:39.560 --> 00:20:41.320
Shut the fuck up!

285
00:20:45.680 --> 00:20:46.840
Cédric.

286
00:20:48.080 --> 00:20:50.800
The terrorist is on the line.
She wants to talk to David.

287
00:20:53.920 --> 00:20:55.720
-David?
-Yeah. I'm listening.

288
00:20:55.800 --> 00:20:59.720
We've got the terrorist on the line.
It's a woman. We'll be listening in.

289
00:21:00.760 --> 00:21:02.320
She wants to talk to you.

290
00:21:04.560 --> 00:21:05.920
Okay. put her on.

291
00:21:06.720 --> 00:21:07.760
Connecting.

292
00:21:32.440 --> 00:21:34.720
You know very well that this is personal.

293
00:21:36.200 --> 00:21:38.640
The GIGN took everything from me.

294
00:21:38.720 --> 00:21:41.640
France took everything from me.

295
00:21:42.760 --> 00:21:45.960
But you? You took my daughter.

296
00:21:46.040 --> 00:21:50.000
My blood. my husband. my family.

297
00:21:50.080 --> 00:21:52.560
I'm a dad too. I'll go get your daughter.

298
00:21:54.560 --> 00:21:55.560
Amal Mayard?

299
00:21:57.120 --> 00:21:58.160
Commander Berger.

300
00:21:58.240 --> 00:21:59.240
Fuck.

301
00:22:02.120 --> 00:22:06.280
Like I said.
it's personal between you and me.

302
00:22:08.640 --> 00:22:10.480
I'm not here to negotiate. David.

303
00:22:12.160 --> 00:22:14.880
Today. I'm going to take
everything from you.

304
00:22:17.360 --> 00:22:19.880
And the whole world
will be there to see it.

305
00:22:25.400 --> 00:22:26.560
Fuck.

306
00:22:27.560 --> 00:22:30.440
In the military.
she specialized in long-range shooting.

307
00:22:32.040 --> 00:22:33.440
I'll take care of Amal.

308
00:22:35.080 --> 00:22:35.920
Let's go. guys.

309
00:22:36.000 --> 00:22:38.320
It's a suicide mission.
She'll execute the hostages.

310
00:22:38.880 --> 00:22:40.080
We have to move in now.

311
00:22:40.920 --> 00:22:42.080
Fuck.

312
00:22:47.080 --> 00:22:47.960
It's nothing.

313
00:22:48.040 --> 00:22:49.480
-Show me your arm.
-I'm fine!

314
00:22:49.560 --> 00:22:51.520
I have to examine you. It's my job.

315
00:22:51.600 --> 00:22:53.440
See. it's nothing. Nothing at all.

316
00:22:53.520 --> 00:22:54.680
-Is he fit?
-Of course.

317
00:22:54.760 --> 00:22:57.240
-Everyone in the Sherpa.
-You're good.

318
00:23:21.000 --> 00:23:22.720
Guys! Listen to me. please.

319
00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:27.040
They have CL20 inside the building.

320
00:23:27.120 --> 00:23:29.960
We can't let them trigger the detonator.

321
00:23:30.040 --> 00:23:33.200
Remember our motto.
"A commitment to life. to all lives."

322
00:23:33.280 --> 00:23:36.080
But there are some situations
where we can't do that.

323
00:23:36.160 --> 00:23:38.840
So. Valère. Djibril. PJ. Nico. Max.

324
00:23:38.920 --> 00:23:41.800
I'll need your shooting skills
because to save the hostages.

325
00:23:41.880 --> 00:23:42.840
we'll have to shoot.

326
00:23:42.920 --> 00:23:44.720
But we'll only have one shot.

327
00:23:46.040 --> 00:23:47.720
So when you shoot. don't miss.

328
00:23:47.800 --> 00:23:50.080
This is a very delicate operation.

329
00:23:50.160 --> 00:23:52.960
Let's make sure
we all go home tonight. please.

330
00:23:53.040 --> 00:23:54.360
Alright. everyone in!

331
00:23:54.440 --> 00:23:55.960
Come on. guys! Go!

332
00:23:56.040 --> 00:23:57.640
-Will you be okay. Valère?
-Yeah.

333
00:23:57.720 --> 00:23:58.800
-Miss Explosive?
-Yes.

334
00:23:58.880 --> 00:24:00.040
Take care of the CL20.

335
00:24:00.120 --> 00:24:01.920
All set. I'm sticking with Intel.

336
00:24:02.000 --> 00:24:03.440
Okay. guys. let's go.

337
00:24:22.520 --> 00:24:23.360
Hello?

338
00:24:23.880 --> 00:24:27.440
Chloé. on the CCTV.
can you see the targets going in?

339
00:24:29.520 --> 00:24:30.440
Affirmative.

340
00:24:31.040 --> 00:24:32.560
Can you see them coming out?

341
00:24:36.200 --> 00:24:37.040
Negative.

342
00:24:37.120 --> 00:24:41.120
Fuck. They still managed to fire at us
from the building next door.

343
00:24:41.200 --> 00:24:42.920
So. there must be…

344
00:24:43.000 --> 00:24:44.400
I don't know. an accomplice?

345
00:24:44.480 --> 00:24:46.120
An underground passageway.

346
00:24:47.480 --> 00:24:48.840
Cédric. we're splitting up.

347
00:24:50.040 --> 00:24:51.680
Okay. guys. Change of plan.

348
00:24:52.240 --> 00:24:55.120
We're looking for a tunnel.
Schwepps. go down that corridor.

349
00:24:55.200 --> 00:24:56.320
We'll meet at the end.

350
00:24:56.400 --> 00:24:59.240
Sergio. you guys take the third floor.

351
00:24:59.320 --> 00:25:00.680
We'll meet at the end.

352
00:25:00.760 --> 00:25:03.680
I'm 15 minutes out.
I'll call you from the warehouse.

353
00:25:03.760 --> 00:25:05.560
Copy that. Sending in the Sherpa.

354
00:25:09.920 --> 00:25:11.080
Cédric?

355
00:25:11.160 --> 00:25:12.600
Any news about Rapha?

356
00:25:12.680 --> 00:25:14.320
She's in good hands.

357
00:25:14.400 --> 00:25:16.520
I need you with me. You know how it goes.

358
00:25:16.600 --> 00:25:18.880
If a teammate goes down. you keep moving.

359
00:25:18.960 --> 00:25:21.120
If you can't do that. get off the truck.

360
00:27:05.840 --> 00:27:07.440
We're in building B.

361
00:27:08.680 --> 00:27:10.440
Man down in corridor S.

362
00:27:13.200 --> 00:27:16.120
Team 1. still in corridor V.
Nothing to report on our end.

363
00:27:17.840 --> 00:27:20.200
Team 2. nothing to report in corridor D.

364
00:27:25.680 --> 00:27:27.360
Crossing over to building A.

365
00:27:32.120 --> 00:27:33.680
Fatality confirmed.

366
00:27:39.960 --> 00:27:41.720
Separate columns.

367
00:28:03.840 --> 00:28:04.920
Freeze!

368
00:28:07.080 --> 00:28:08.560
Turn around slowly.

369
00:28:10.520 --> 00:28:11.960
Your weapon on the ground.

370
00:28:15.200 --> 00:28:16.600
Hands on your head.

371
00:28:30.000 --> 00:28:30.960
No!

372
00:28:31.800 --> 00:28:32.920
Not like this.

373
00:28:39.760 --> 00:28:40.960
I want him alive.

374
00:28:45.000 --> 00:28:46.320
He's going to see it all.

375
00:28:47.800 --> 00:28:50.240
He's going to find out how it feels.

376
00:29:06.200 --> 00:29:07.040
You're surrounded.

377
00:29:09.920 --> 00:29:12.120
Your men will all be killed or arrested.

378
00:29:15.240 --> 00:29:16.480
It's over.

379
00:29:20.800 --> 00:29:24.040
It won't be over until I say so.

380
00:29:37.760 --> 00:29:38.880
We're on the roof.

381
00:29:44.480 --> 00:29:48.720
There are still five terrorists in there.
Three with hostages. two on the stairs.

382
00:29:57.400 --> 00:29:59.400
Fire support snipers in position.

383
00:30:06.400 --> 00:30:07.360
Okay.

384
00:30:08.440 --> 00:30:10.960
Section 1 ready to enter the auditorium.

385
00:30:33.320 --> 00:30:34.920
David. do you copy?

386
00:30:35.960 --> 00:30:37.960
Fuck! We found him.

387
00:30:39.760 --> 00:30:42.160
David!

388
00:30:42.960 --> 00:30:43.840
Are you okay?

389
00:30:44.920 --> 00:30:46.360
-I'm okay.
-Can you get up?

390
00:30:46.440 --> 00:30:47.360
Yeah.

391
00:30:48.200 --> 00:30:49.640
We're returning to corridor N.

392
00:30:49.720 --> 00:30:50.840
Thank you. Come on.

393
00:30:53.440 --> 00:30:55.760
On my mark. Three seconds to fire.

394
00:30:56.480 --> 00:30:58.600
Snipers. report status when ready.

395
00:31:12.000 --> 00:31:12.840
One ready.

396
00:31:13.520 --> 00:31:14.520
Two ready.

397
00:31:14.600 --> 00:31:15.680
Three ready.

398
00:31:15.760 --> 00:31:16.880
Four ready.

399
00:31:16.960 --> 00:31:18.200
Five not visible.

400
00:31:18.280 --> 00:31:20.600
Okay. Everyone stay on their target.

401
00:31:21.480 --> 00:31:24.360
Max. let us know when you're ready.
You give the go-ahead.

402
00:32:04.040 --> 00:32:05.320
Target five exposed.

403
00:32:05.920 --> 00:32:06.800
Start the sequence.

404
00:32:14.240 --> 00:32:15.080
One ready.

405
00:32:15.160 --> 00:32:16.160
Two ready.

406
00:32:16.240 --> 00:32:17.520
Three ready.

407
00:32:17.600 --> 00:32:18.560
Four ready.

408
00:32:18.640 --> 00:32:19.840
Five ready.

409
00:32:19.920 --> 00:32:21.840
Countdown. Three seconds.

410
00:32:22.880 --> 00:32:23.920
Three.

411
00:32:29.600 --> 00:32:30.960
Go!

412
00:32:31.960 --> 00:32:35.520
Police!

413
00:32:35.600 --> 00:32:37.000
No one moves!

414
00:32:51.520 --> 00:32:52.600
Okay. we're clear!

415
00:32:53.400 --> 00:32:54.720
Target one neutralized.

416
00:32:54.800 --> 00:32:56.800
Target two neutralized.

417
00:32:59.160 --> 00:33:01.040
Attention. priority alert.

418
00:33:01.760 --> 00:33:04.640
Two men down in corridor S.
Amal wounded. I'm in pursuit.

419
00:33:05.200 --> 00:33:06.880
Five terrorists down. Confirmed.

420
00:33:06.960 --> 00:33:09.600
Tanya. stay with me.
Everyone else. evacuate the hostages.

421
00:33:10.200 --> 00:33:12.480
We found the rest of the CL20 stock.

422
00:33:14.120 --> 00:33:16.400
We're evacuating the hostages.
do you copy?

423
00:33:16.480 --> 00:33:19.120
Check their identity and evacuate.

424
00:33:23.720 --> 00:33:24.960
Tanya. how's it looking?

425
00:33:26.120 --> 00:33:28.480
The last Oscar is handcuffed
to the device.

426
00:33:29.520 --> 00:33:30.840
It's all wired to a timer.

427
00:33:31.640 --> 00:33:34.000
The countdown hasn't been activated.

428
00:33:35.240 --> 00:33:37.120
The handcuffs could be rigged.

429
00:33:39.640 --> 00:33:41.880
It's clearly a remote trigger.

430
00:33:48.440 --> 00:33:49.800
Oscar nine. Okay.

431
00:33:50.880 --> 00:33:52.520
Oscar four. Okay.

432
00:33:56.640 --> 00:33:59.560
David. Amal must have a trigger on her.

433
00:34:02.400 --> 00:34:04.120
Oscar seven. Okay.

434
00:34:05.400 --> 00:34:06.680
Oscar eight. Okay.

435
00:34:45.520 --> 00:34:46.680
Don't do that.

436
00:34:49.720 --> 00:34:50.960
Manon.

437
00:34:51.040 --> 00:34:52.280
It's Cédric.

438
00:34:53.120 --> 00:34:54.760
It's going to be okay.

439
00:34:56.240 --> 00:34:57.320
Put it down.

440
00:34:59.800 --> 00:35:01.600
You think you've won?

441
00:35:10.760 --> 00:35:12.040
Just like me.

442
00:35:13.040 --> 00:35:14.480
you'll lose everything.

443
00:35:16.400 --> 00:35:17.360
Right now.

444
00:35:18.000 --> 00:35:19.160
No!

445
00:35:21.200 --> 00:35:23.120
Fuck. Cédric. the countdown just started.

446
00:35:23.200 --> 00:35:26.840
Five minutes. We need to evacuate
the conservatory now.

447
00:35:26.920 --> 00:35:28.880
All sections. evacuate immediately.

448
00:35:28.960 --> 00:35:32.240
Hostages first. I repeat. hostages first.

449
00:35:32.320 --> 00:35:34.840
Copy that.
We're evacuating them via building B.

450
00:35:35.360 --> 00:35:36.800
Eight identified. none injured.

451
00:35:38.880 --> 00:35:40.280
Oscar 3 is missing.

452
00:35:40.360 --> 00:35:42.960
Come on. We're leaving.
Follow the officers. hurry up.

453
00:35:43.040 --> 00:35:44.080
Come on!

454
00:35:45.920 --> 00:35:47.240
Who's Oscar 3?

455
00:35:50.800 --> 00:35:51.880
Who's Oscar 3?

456
00:35:53.440 --> 00:35:54.960
Cédric. tell him.

457
00:35:56.320 --> 00:35:57.600
It's Manon.

458
00:36:00.640 --> 00:36:02.400
Hey. Manon. It's going to be okay.

459
00:36:10.680 --> 00:36:14.040
It's going to be okay.
Okay. stay with me. Breathe out.

460
00:36:14.560 --> 00:36:15.600
Breathe.

461
00:36:18.320 --> 00:36:20.120
Something weird about this setup.

462
00:36:20.960 --> 00:36:23.160
-I'll deploy a jammer and secure Manon.
-Okay.

463
00:36:25.680 --> 00:36:27.040
Guys!

464
00:36:27.120 --> 00:36:29.520
Everyone out! There's enough of us.
We've got this!

465
00:36:31.640 --> 00:36:32.840
We've got this!

466
00:36:42.160 --> 00:36:44.640
-Tanya. how long?
-Four minutes.

467
00:36:44.720 --> 00:36:48.560
You never listen. do you? Come on. focus.
Come back to me. Breathe with me.

468
00:36:55.560 --> 00:36:58.440
Just got a hit.
Storage unit 237 belongs to Amal Mayard.

469
00:36:58.520 --> 00:36:59.520
Okay. we're on site.

470
00:37:12.800 --> 00:37:14.600
I'm setting up the jammer.

471
00:37:17.840 --> 00:37:20.600
Manon. you've got to trust me.
It's going to be okay.

472
00:37:23.200 --> 00:37:24.280
Come on.

473
00:37:24.360 --> 00:37:26.960
-Manon. did they put something on you?
-I don't know.

474
00:37:27.040 --> 00:37:28.480
Just look at me.

475
00:37:41.560 --> 00:37:42.840
Okay. it'll be alright.

476
00:37:46.520 --> 00:37:47.360
-Dad.
-Hey.

477
00:37:47.960 --> 00:37:49.920
Are you okay? Yes?

478
00:37:50.000 --> 00:37:51.800
-Awesome. How much time?
-2:30.

479
00:37:51.880 --> 00:37:53.040
2 minutes 30.

480
00:37:53.120 --> 00:37:54.280
What happened?

481
00:37:54.360 --> 00:37:57.440
Do you like it? I look like a badass.
Should I keep it?

482
00:37:58.000 --> 00:38:00.360
At one minute. we'll have to get out.

483
00:38:00.440 --> 00:38:01.840
What does he mean?

484
00:38:01.920 --> 00:38:04.200
We'll all have to get out.
that's what he means.

485
00:38:04.280 --> 00:38:05.120
-Right?
-Yeah.

486
00:38:05.200 --> 00:38:10.160
We're with the best. We're with Tanya.
You know her. She's lethal. Okay?

487
00:38:10.240 --> 00:38:13.520
Do you know where she's from?
No? Nobody else does either.

488
00:38:13.600 --> 00:38:15.240
Cédric. you don't know. do you?

489
00:38:16.880 --> 00:38:18.600
We've reached the second floor.

490
00:38:19.840 --> 00:38:21.960
We're heading towards storage unit 237.

491
00:38:22.040 --> 00:38:23.320
Max. you can go.

492
00:38:23.400 --> 00:38:25.080
It's okay. my love.

493
00:38:27.160 --> 00:38:28.560
Get moving. Now.

494
00:38:29.960 --> 00:38:30.920
I'm staying put.

495
00:38:37.000 --> 00:38:39.800
Clear. There's no one in here.

496
00:38:42.480 --> 00:38:43.320
Fuck.

497
00:38:45.560 --> 00:38:47.640
Manon is secure. I need the bolt cutters.

498
00:38:47.720 --> 00:38:49.120
-Okay.
-What for?

499
00:38:49.200 --> 00:38:51.920
-We're going to get out. We'll run.
-What's happening?

500
00:38:52.000 --> 00:38:54.960
-I can't run. I'm too tired.
-I'll carry you.

501
00:38:55.520 --> 00:38:57.160
-Tanya. talk to me.
-My legs hurt.

502
00:38:57.240 --> 00:38:59.160
-We're not taking any risks.
-It's okay.

503
00:38:59.240 --> 00:39:01.280
-We cut her free and run. Okay?
-Come on.

504
00:39:02.280 --> 00:39:04.880
All right. go. run!

505
00:39:13.560 --> 00:39:15.520
Fuck. she's the one who killed Kröller.

506
00:39:15.600 --> 00:39:17.040
LINA MAYARD: A LIFE CUT SHORT

507
00:39:17.800 --> 00:39:18.800
Go!

508
00:39:18.880 --> 00:39:20.920
Dad. put me down. it's fine.

509
00:39:22.480 --> 00:39:23.320
Come on!

510
00:39:36.160 --> 00:39:37.320
Fuck.

511
00:39:48.040 --> 00:39:48.960
David?

512
00:39:49.760 --> 00:39:50.840
Where's Jess?

513
00:39:51.360 --> 00:39:52.440
It's Jess.

514
00:39:52.520 --> 00:39:53.800
Do you copy?

515
00:39:54.320 --> 00:39:55.360
David.

516
00:39:55.440 --> 00:39:57.520
It's Jess. Jess is the target.

517
00:40:03.920 --> 00:40:05.120
David. do you copy?

518
00:46:04.560 --> 00:46:09.560
Subtitle translation by: Alison Simpson
